(Japanese: '''水の都の護神ラティアスとラティオス''' ''Guardian Gods of the City of Water: Latias and Latios'') is a graphic novel published by [[Shogakukan]] in Japan. It is a manga-style book (often branded as "Animation Comics" or "Ani-Manga") which retells the plotlines of ''[[M05|Pokémon Heroes: Latios & Latias]]'' and ''[[PK11|Camp Pikachu]]'' using screenshots from both films. The book credits [[Hideki Sonoda]] and [[Takeshi Shudō]] as the authors.

